        "video_id": "2r0QahNdwMw",
        "lecture": 22,
        "kind": "procedure",
        "importance": 3,
        "text": "With shortcut connections, each step adds the current layer output to the running input or output from previous layers, so the final result accumulates all previous shortcut additions.",
