        "video_id": "2r0QahNdwMw",
        "lecture": 22,
        "kind": "procedure",
        "importance": 3,
        "text": "To summarize gradient flow per layer, the lecturer performs a backward pass, computes the gradients for all weights in a layer, and takes the mean of those values as the layer's mean gradient.",
        "line_ids": [
          "2r0QahNdwMw@1484",
          "2r0QahNdwMw@1487",
          "2r0QahNdwMw@1489",
          "2r0QahNdwMw@1491",
