          "2r0QahNdwMw@1498",
          "2r0QahNdwMw@1500",
          "2r0QahNdwMw@1501",
          "2r0QahNdwMw@1503",
          "2r0QahNdwMw@1506",
          "2r0QahNdwMw@1508",
          "2r0QahNdwMw@1510",
          "2r0QahNdwMw@1513",
          "2r0QahNdwMw@1515"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "2r0QahNdwMw:p042",
        "video_id": "2r0QahNdwMw",
        "lecture": 22,
        "kind": "equation",
        "importance": 2,
        "text": "The loss is defined as the squared difference between the model output y and the ground truth, for example (y - 0) squared when the ground truth is zero.",
        "line_ids": [
          "2r0QahNdwMw@1527",
          "2r0QahNdwMw@1530",
          "2r0QahNdwMw@1532",
          "2r0QahNdwMw@1534",
          "2r0QahNdwMw@1538"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "2r0QahNdwMw:p043",
        "video_id": "2r0QahNdwMw",
        "lecture": 22,
        "kind": "procedure",
        "importance": 3,
        "text": "In backpropagation, the partial derivatives of the loss are computed starting from the output layer and then moving backward through earlier layers until the first layer.",
        "line_ids": [
          "2r0QahNdwMw@1542",
          "2r0QahNdwMw@1544",
          "2r0QahNdwMw@1546",
          "2r0QahNdwMw@1547",
          "2r0QahNdwMw@1549",
          "2r0QahNdwMw@1551",
          "2r0QahNdwMw@1552",
          "2r0QahNdwMw@1554",
          "2r0QahNdwMw@1556",
          "2r0QahNdwMw@1557",
          "2r0QahNdwMw@1559",
          "2r0QahNdwMw@1561",
          "2r0QahNdwMw@1562",
          "2r0QahNdwMw@1565",
          "2r0QahNdwMw@1566"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "2r0QahNdwMw:p044",
        "video_id": "2r0QahNdwMw",
        "lecture": 22,
        "kind": "code",
        "importance": 3,
        "text": "The code sets the target to zero, computes the model output for x, uses a squared loss, calls loss.backward(), and then prints a single gradient value per layer by taking the mean of each layer's gradient matrix.",
        "line_ids": [
          "2r0QahNdwMw@1568",
          "2r0QahNdwMw@1570",
          "2r0QahNdwMw@1573",
          "2r0QahNdwMw@1574",
          "2r0QahNdwMw@1576",
          "2r0QahNdwMw@1578",
